# Cloudflare Pages headers. The CSP makes the privacy page's claims enforceable
# rather than aspirational: nothing loads from anywhere but this origin, and the
# only inline script allowed is the pre-paint theme snippet, by hash. If that
# snippet changes in any byte, recompute:
#   python3 -c "import hashlib,base64,re,pathlib; s=re.search(r'<script>(.*?)</script>', pathlib.Path('index.html').read_text(), re.S).group(1); print('sha256-'+base64.b64encode(hashlib.sha256(s.encode()).digest()).decode())"

